<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  9.33%			 C/S =  7.64%</p>
<p>	    O/N =  5.09%			 O/N =  7.64%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 11.88%			 T/N =  9.34%</p>
<p>		   Dec  27, 1996			Dec  26, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.37%	1 month forward =  8.49%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.09%	2 month forward =  8.32%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.44%	3 month forward =  8.94%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.61%	4 month forward =  8.49%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.58%	5 month forward =  8.15%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.42%	6 month forward =  7.87%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
